      "texto": {
        "en": "**The app cannot check this part.** For the writing, please use pen and paper. For the speaking, say it out loud and, if you can, practise with a native speaker or a teacher who can correct you.\n\n**Write (30–40 words).** Write about your wider family: grandparents, uncles, aunts and cousins. Say how many there are and where they live.\n\n**Speak (about 30 seconds).** Explain aloud who three relatives are in relation to you: Carmen es la hermana de mi madre: es mi tía."
